# TC-001: Hess-law route comparison: lime hydration before neutralisation
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
measure v1 thermometer
measure v1 calorimeter
add v1 CaO 0.001mol
measure v1 thermometer
measure v1 calorimeter
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CaO 0.001mol
measure v2 thermometer
measure v2 calorimeter
add v2 HCl 0.002mol
measure v2 thermometer
measure v2 calorimeter
inspect
